release build from `74b12df` bundled `ecac0d2b…` (3,737,888 B) for
`libksud.so` and `ea0505cd…` (4,728,320 B — same size as the reviewed bytes,
so only SHA-256 distinguished it) for `libksudnext.so`. Non-tag CI builds Debug
