-----------------

The LKM binary is intentionally NOT committed. It is built from
`lkm/dfroot.c` (GPL-2.0-only, `MODULE_LICENSE("GPL")`) by the top-level
`Makefile` (one podman build for the single KMI `android13-5.15`, using the
