(`.github/workflows/build.yml`), and copied to
`app/src/main/jni/ko/dfroot-android13-5.15.ko` (all `*.ko` under that directory
are gitignored). CI post-processes the LKM with `llvm-objcopy --strip-unneeded`
plus `-R …` section removals (including `.note.gnu.build-id`), so a stripped CI
artifact and an unstripped local `make` output are not byte-identical. Their
**reported historical** fingerprints are recorded in the qualified note below
("Embedded LKM integrity pin") and consolidated in PORTING-GZIF.md §7; they are
repository records, not verified output of this checkout or an established
same-source build identity. Fresh clones must run the LKM build
(or download CI artifacts) before `assembleRelease`; see README.md and
PORTING-GZIF.md §8.

